Type: project
Package: livesport.data
Title: Livesport Match Data Scraper
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Automated daily scraping of match results and schedules from
    livesport.com for football and handball leagues. Data committed to git
    for consumption by the Sports betting pipeline.
